                <pb facs="1186" n="1090" sameAs="frus:frus1874/pg1090"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Meeting.</hi></head>
                <p>At half past five yesterday afternoon his excellency, the minister of ultramar,
                    presided over a meeting of authorities, which was also attended by the colonels
                    of volunteers of this city, and a few other persons invited to that effect. To
                    the inquiry which his excellency made, several of those present replied with the
                    greatest loyalty, and there were replies as noble, and worthy to figure at its
                    side, as that of Mendez Nunez: “Spain prefers honor without vessels, than
                    vessels without honor.”</p>
            </div>
